{"id":"n5-130","title":"まだ〜ないです (mada 〜 nai desu)","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Expresses that something has not happened or been done yet.","longExplanation":"The まだ〜ないです grammar point is used to indicate that a certain action or event has not yet happened or been completed. It is used with the negative form of a verb (casual negative + です) and can be translated as 'not yet', 'still', or 'haven't' in English.","formation":"まだ + Verb-negative + です","examples":[{"jp":"まだ宿題をしていないです。","romaji":"Mada shukudai o shite inai desu.","en":"I haven't done my homework yet.","words":[{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"宿題","vocabId":"1337270","reading":"しゅくだい"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[0,7]},{"jp":"彼はまだ来ないです。","romaji":"Kare wa mada konai desu.","en":"He hasn't come yet.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"来","vocabId":"1547710","reading":"らい","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,5]},{"jp":"映画はまだ始まっていないです。","romaji":"Eiga wa mada hajimatte inai desu.","en":"The movie hasn't started yet.","words":[{"surface":"映画","vocabId":"1173720","reading":"えいが"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"始まっ","vocabId":"1307500","reading":"はじまる","baseForm":"始まる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,7]},{"jp":"私たちはまだ夕食を食べていないです。","romaji":"Watashitachi wa mada yuushoku o tabete inai desu.","en":"We haven't eaten dinner yet.","words":[{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"たち","vocabId":"1416220","reading":"たち"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"夕食","vocabId":"1542730","reading":"ゆうしょく"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"食べ","vocabId":"1358280","reading":"たべる","baseForm":"食べる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,10]}]}